1
00:00:16,233 --> 00:00:23,906
Larry: Taking the charge. Alma's got a girl in Pittsburgh and the place is going dark. You guys shoot the ballroom tonight, I'll be back.

2
00:00:57,733 --> 00:01:04,853
Larry: Second take. She talked longer than the first. Charge died on the third word of the fourth sentence. You'll hear it.

3
00:01:05,817 --> 00:01:10,144
Rita: It's going to her. You don't have to say thank you. Go home, Alma.
